<h3><u>faatahe lashkar ali ali</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><big>allah allah<br>hayya ala khairil amal<br>har gustaakhe rasul ko dunya se ham mitaayenge<br>har gustaakhe ehle bayt ko dunya se ham mitaayenge<br><br>jo ali ka nahin wo nabi ka nahin&nbsp;<br>jo nabi ka nahin wo khuda ka nahin&nbsp;<br>jo khuda ka nahin wo kisi ka nahin&nbsp;<br><br>hai dil me hamaare ishqe ali<br>hai dil me hamaare ishqe nabi<br>har dushmane aale mohammad<br>eilaan hamaara sun le<br><br>ham ko maalum hai maqtal se guzarna kya hai<br>ruh zinda hai to phir jism ka marna kya hai<br>baad az marg hame ishq rakhega zinda<br>kar liya ishq to phir maut se darna kiya hai<br><br>seenon me shauqe shahaadat basaa ke<br>haathon me ghaazi ka parcham utha ke<br>paighaam dete huwe karbala ke<br>barhte rahein zulmaton ko mitaa ke<br>zindagi ko waqf karke hussain ke naam<br>bas ek naara ho wirde zabaan<br><br>barhhta rahe kaarwaan jiyo hussaini jawaan&nbsp;<br>hai mire kaarwaan<br>faatahe lashkar ya ali ya ali maula ali&nbsp;<br><br>hal min naasirin yan surana<br><br>ham noha khwaan aur iraade hamaare<br>talwaar hain<br>ek do nahin balke saare ke saare<br>mukhtaar hain<br>nauhe ke alfaaz denge gawaahi<br>ham hain imaame zamaan ke sipaahi<br>jurrat me meesum wilaayat ke raahi<br>thhokar me rakhte hain ham takhte shaahi<br>kaafi hai bas sayyada ki duaa hi<br>mil ke bolein saare momin peer o jawaan<br>daste karam ho imaame zamaan<br><br>laashe uthaaye uthaate rahenge<br>majlis me jaate hain jaate rahenge<br>tufaan to aate hain aate rahenge<br>ham apni himmat barhhaate rahenge<br>ghar lute ya jaan jaaye khuda ki qasam<br>dete rahenge yehi ham azaan<br><br>hayya ala khairil amal<br>maula imaam hussain (as) farmaate hain<br>agar zindagi ka ikhtetaam maut par hi hai<br>to us ka behtareen intekhaab shahaadat hai<br><br>wirsa hai hamaara shahaadat<br>shahaadat shahaadat<br>kehte hain jise ham saaadat<br>saaadat saaadat<br><br>karam hussain ka mujh par mazeed hojaaye<br>marun to lehed me maula ki deed hojaaye<br>ajeeb jazba hai<br>ajeeb jazba hai har maan duaayein karti hai<br>khuda kare mera bachha shaheed hojaaye<br><br>ay maan<br>khuch khauf nahin ab mujhe izzat me kami ka<br>shajra hai khuda rakhe hussaini hassani ka<br>likh dena kafan par mere bas tum ali waaris<br>khud qabr samajh jaayegi banda hun ali ka<br><br>shaheed zinda hai<br>shaheed zinda hai<br><br>shaheed qabr ki jaanib chala to aise chala<br>dil me haider ki wila mun pe male khaake shifa<br>saath maatam ke nishaan aur shahaadat naama<br>jab huwa qabr me daakhil to ye manzar dekha<br>misle gulshan ke tar o taaza nazar aati hai<br>qabr to khuld ka darwaaza nazar aati hai<br><br>shaheed zinda hai<br>shaheed zinda hai<br><br>di nida haatife ghaibi ne ke ab ho hoshyaar<br>murtaza qabr me aate hain basad izz o wiqaar<br>meri turbat me ajab tarha ki aayi hai bahaar<br>kya haseen maut hai is maut pe so zeest nisaar<br>mera mola meri turbat me chala aaya hai<br>asl me ab mujhe marne ka maza aaya hai<br><br>shaheed zindah hai<br>shaheed zindah hai<br><br>ay ehle jahaan socho to zara<br>hai fikr ki jaa rone ki fazaa<br>jab apna koyi marjaata hai<br>karbal ka kafan wo paata hai<br>ehbaab o aziz aur dost sabhi<br>rone ke liye aa jaate hain<br>kis shaan se apne pyaaron ki<br>mayyat ko sabhi dafnaate hain<br>afsos magar zehra ka pisar<br><br>ya hussain ya hussain<br>ya hussain ya hussain<br><br>afsos magar zehra ka pisar<br>chaalis dinon tak be sar tha<br>us laashe pe sadqe kaun o makaan<br>na kafan mila na dafn huwa<br><br>haaye<br><br>had huwa karti hai har zulm ke afsaane ki<br>zulm sehne ki sitam sehne ki gham khaane ki<br>kalma goyo yehi ek baat hai rulwaane ki<br>rasm hai saare musalmaanon me dafnaane ki<br>par mohammad ke nawaase ko kafan bhi na mila<br><br>rone ke liye kaafi hai ay mazhar o farhaan<br>paaya kafan shaheedon ne aur dafn ka saamaan<br>par mohammad ke nawaase ko kafan bhi na mila<br>hussain mola hussain mola</big></p>
